      'Chaos Space Marines, Dark Eldar, Escalation — the same counting fixed the Chaos Rhino\'s second Combi-bolter, the Helbrute swapping its Power scourge for a second Helbrute fist, the Venom trading its Twin splinter rifle for a second Splinter cannon, and the Armiger trading its Chain-cleaver for a second autocannon.',
      'Signing in takes effect straight away — no refreshing the page. The login itself always worked, but the header and the account button were reading their own separate copy of the session, so they kept showing "Log in" until you reloaded. Changing your avatar and logging out now update everywhere immediately too (reported on Discord).',
