      'Eldar — Guardian Defenders only show the heavy weapon once a Heavy weapon platform is actually in the squad. The datasheet\'s second loadout line, "Every Heavy weapon platform is equipped with: Scatter laser", was missing, so the weapon read as squad-wide equipment. Storm Guardians had the same gap (GitHub #87).',
