      'GENERAL — vehicles are no longer offered the infantry Armory. No vehicle datasheet in the game grants it, and the general sections carry no vehicle price; 188 vehicles across 17 factions could buy power swords and jump packs at the normal-model price. Ork vehicles keep their Kustom jobs, which are their own section (user report).',
      'Orks — a unit can take one Kustom job, and each job once per army, as the Armory says. Neither limit was enforced: a Trukk could buy all sixteen, and every unit could take the same one. \'Eavy armour cabin grants light cover, not cover.',
